{
  "name": "vscode-ai-commit",
  "displayName": "AI Commit Message",
  "description": "使用 OpenAI 兼容接口，根据已暂存的 Git 变更生成提交消息。",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "publisher": "lhp9916",
  "license": "MIT",
  "icon": "media/icon.png",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/lhp9916/vscode-ai-commit.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "SCM Providers",
    "Other"
  ],
  "galleryBanner": {
    "color": "#17223B",
    "theme": "dark"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "git",
    "commit",
    "ai",
    "deepseek",
    "qwen"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "aiCommit.generateMessage",
        "title": "AI 生成提交消息",
        "category": "AI Commit Message",
        "icon": {
          "light": "media/ai-commit-light.svg",
          "dark": "media/ai-commit-dark.svg"
        }
      },
      {
        "command": "aiCommit.openSettings",
        "title": "打开完整设置",
        "category": "AI Commit Message"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "scm/title": [
        {
          "command": "aiCommit.generateMessage",
          "when": "scmProvider == git",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "aiCommit.generateMessage",
          "when": "scmProvider == git"
        },
        {
          "command": "aiCommit.openSettings"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "AI Commit Message",
      "properties": {
        "aiCommit.provider": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "deepseek",
            "dashscope",
            "zhipu",
            "moonshot",
            "siliconflow",
            "custom"
          ],
          "enumItemLabels": [
            "DeepSeek",
            "通义千问 DashScope",
            "智谱 GLM",
            "Kimi Moonshot",
            "硅基流动 SiliconFlow",
            "自定义（OpenAI 兼容接口）"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "DeepSeek 官方 API。",
            "阿里云百炼/通义千问的 OpenAI 兼容接口。",
            "智谱开放平台的 OpenAI 兼容接口。",
            "Kimi 开放平台的 OpenAI 兼容接口。",
            "SiliconFlow 的 OpenAI 兼容接口。",
            "自行填写 Base URL 与模型名称。"
          ],
          "default": "deepseek",
          "markdownDescription": "**模型服务供应商**。执行 `AI Commit Message: 打开完整设置` 可获得带下拉选项的完整配置面板。",
          "order": 1
        },
        "aiCommit.baseUrl": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "**Base URL**。OpenAI 兼容接口地址；留空时使用所选供应商的默认地址。",
          "order": 2
        },
        "aiCommit.model": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "**模型名称**。留空时使用供应商默认模型；在完整设置面板中可点击“获取模型”从接口拉取。",
          "order": 3
        },
        "aiCommit.messageStyle": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "conventionalZh",
            "plainZh",
            "conventionalEn"
          ],
          "enumItemLabels": [
            "中文 Conventional Commits",
            "中文纯描述",
            "English Conventional Commits"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "中文消息，带 feat、fix 等类型前缀。示例：feat(upload): 添加上传文件日志",
            "中文单行描述，不带类型前缀。示例：添加上传文件日志",
            "英文消息，带 Conventional Commits 类型前缀。示例：feat(upload): add upload logging"
          ],
          "default": "conventionalZh",
          "markdownDescription": "**提交消息风格（Message Style）**：决定生成结果长什么样。\n\n- **中文 Conventional Commits**：`feat(upload): 添加上传文件日志`，适合使用提交规范的中文团队。\n- **中文纯描述**：`添加上传文件日志`，只保留一句说明，不带类型前缀。\n- **English Conventional Commits**：`feat(upload): add upload logging`，英文提交规范。\n\n“Conventional Commits”是一种通用提交格式：`类型(模块): 描述`。",
          "order": 4
        },
        "aiCommit.strictMode": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "markdownDescription": "**严格模式**。按 Conventional Commits 校验生成结果；不合规时自动让模型重写一次。",
          "order": 5
        },
        "aiCommit.extraPrompt": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "editPresentation": "multilineText",
          "markdownDescription": "**附加要求**。追加到系统提示词，例如“不要使用 emoji”“正文使用简短要点”。",
          "order": 6
        },
        "aiCommit.perFileChars": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 6000,
          "minimum": 1,
          "markdownDescription": "**单文件差异上限**（字符）。超出时截断该文件差异，但保留完整文件清单。",
          "order": 7
        },
        "aiCommit.totalChars": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 24000,
          "minimum": 1,
          "markdownDescription": "**总差异上限**（字符）。所有文件差异合计超过后，后续文件只保留在清单中。",
          "order": 8
        },
        "aiCommit.timeoutSeconds": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 60,
          "minimum": 5,
          "markdownDescription": "**请求超时**（秒）。网络较慢时可适当增大。",
          "order": 9
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc -p .",
    "watch": "tsc -p . --watch",
    "lint": "eslint src",
    "test": "npm run compile && node scripts/run-tests.js",
    "test:integration": "npm run compile && node scripts/run-integration-tests.js",
    "package": "npm run compile && npx @vscode/vsce package --no-dependencies --allow-missing-repository",
    "publish": "npm run compile && npx @vscode/vsce publish --no-dependencies --allow-missing-repository",
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.17.0",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.85.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin": "^8.18.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/parser": "^8.18.0",
    "@vscode/test-electron": "^3.1.0",
    "@vscode/vsce": "^3.2.1",
    "eslint": "^8.57.1",
    "typescript": "^5.7.2"
  }
}
